-- Proof sketch: take the smallest full subcategory generated by the given set of objects and
-- closed under the zero object, kernels, cokernels, and finite products. The closure conditions
-- make the resulting full subcategory abelian by `CategoryTheory.Abelian.Subcategory`.
/-- Remark 19.9.4: every set-sized family of objects in an abelian category is contained in a
